## 🎮 Neon Orchard — Complete

**Summary:** Neon Orchard is live — a polished, responsive, single-file browser game (`index.html` ~830 lines, no build). Slide the woven basket with Arrow keys / A-D or drag/touch to catch glowing fruit (peach +10, grape +12, star +15, apple +20 with combo bonus) and dodge rocks (−1 life). Features: score / best (localStorage) / level / lives (♥♥♥) HUD, intensity meter, falling physics with wall bounce, particles + floating +score, combo xN, level-up banner, screen shake + hit flash + invuln, neon orchard backdrop with grid and hills, start/pause (P/Esc) / game-over → restart flow, WebAudio bleeps, and responsive layout with mobile touch zones.

**Public game link:** https://nut-notes-inflation-compete.trycloudflare.com
- Alternate raw: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/7d7af93d9264b1384c5c5048e981891821fa3448/index.html
- Repo view: https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/blob/7d7af93d9264b1384c5c5048e981891821fa3448/index.html

**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/7d7af93d9264b1384c5c5048e981891821fa3448
