- History: `11e3776` feat initial game → `340d5f7` fix TDZ/basket → `7d7af93` refresh screenshots from public URL

**Deployment and test status:**
- ✅ Deployed via `tmux` session `app-server` (`python3 -m http.server 3000` on 0.0.0.0:3000) + Cloudflare Tunnel → public URL verified `200` and playable
- ✅ Browser verification (Playwright 1.62.1 / Chromium 151) against public URL: PASS — title “Neon Orchard — Catch the Glow”, canvas #game, HUD score/best/hearts/level, start overlay visible, Play click → overlay hidden + running:true, spawn items=3 after 2.5s, ArrowRight/A movement, pause/resume, mobile 375px viewport
- ✅ Local verification also PASS on http://localhost:3000 (same build)
- ✅ Syntax: `node --check` on extracted script PASS (24349B), no build step required
- ✅ Screenshots recaptured directly from public URL and committed

**Known limitations:** None — fully playable. Optional Google Fonts degrade gracefully offline; WebAudio requires user gesture; best score persists via localStorage per browser.

